  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Elk Grove, Soulution Ink Tattoo specializes in crafting stunning custom tattoos with a focus on intricate black & gray and vibrant floral designs. Their skilled artists, including the sought-after talents of @jsoulink, @mana_makia, and @agapealohaartistry, offer a unique blend of creativity and precision, extending their artistry to permanent makeup. While eager skin art enthusiasts must await their next booking window, each completed piece at Soulution Ink Tattoo stands as a testament to their dedication to bespoke body art.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Elk Grove, California, United States"
